Your have to turn your sets into vectors objects first. You 
could do this in one step with readLines 

A <- readLines("A.file")

or after read.delim() you would convert the resulting data frames to
vectors like this:

A <- read.delim ("A.file")
A <- as.character(as.matrix(A))

Thomas

