>> mraw <- read.Spot(targets = swirlTargets, path = datadir)
> Reading ...  C:/PROGRA~1/R/R-211~1.0/library/marray/swirldata/swirl.1.spot
> Reading ...  C:/PROGRA~1/R/R-211~1.0/library/marray/swirldata/swirl.2.spot
